containing nucleosomes at the centromere 5/52 0.459 −2.04 1.59 Nucleosome assembly 5/52 0.459 −2.03 1.58 WikiPathways 2016 Apoptosis modulation and signaling 8/93 0.353 −2.09 2.18 Complement and coagulation cascades 6/59 0.353 −1.90 1.98 Apoptosis modulation by HSP70 3/19 0.412 −1.49 1.32\n\n===\n\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'temperature': 1.0}'
